    "Kayoi 会先推出正在使用文件缓存的卷。SMB 共享不会推出，设备上的文件不会删除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi will eject volumes that use the file cache. SMB shares stay mounted and device files are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi 会先推出正在使用文件缓存的卷。SMB 共享不会推出，设备上的文件不会删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kayoi 会打开服务商授权页，完成后自动返回。应用凭据只在构建配置中提供。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi opens the provider's sign-in page and returns automatically. App credentials are provided only in the build configuration."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi 会打开服务商授权页，完成后自动返回。应用凭据只在构建配置中提供。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kayoi 使用系统文件服务连接设备和服务，不上传你的文件内容。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi uses system file services to connect devices and services. It does not upload your files."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi 使用系统文件服务连接设备和服务，不上传你的文件内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Kayoi 保存的位置、密钥和本地缓存会删除，设备或网盘上的文件不会受影响。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saved locations, keys, and local cache will be deleted. Files on the device or cloud service are not affected."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kayoi 保存的位置、密钥和本地缓存会删除，设备或网盘上的文件不会受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
